01)SortExec: expr=[x@1 ASC NULLS LAST], preserve_partitioning=[false]
02)--HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=Left, on=[(k@0, k@0)], projection=[c@1, x@3]
03)----FilterExec: c@1 = 5
04)------DataSourceExec: partitions=1, partition_sizes=[1]
05)----DataSourceExec: partitions=1, partition_sizes=[1]

